WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Choose dark or light fabric to match the garment. Set white ink independently for regular and black regions.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Check artwork dimensions, resolution, white-ink choke and margins, then start processing.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
When processing is complete, export a TIFF for the next printing step.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:40.000
In Photoshop, inspect the color artwork and the white-ink channel to check how they align.
